<title>USA: Franklin Bank N.A. Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Franklin Bank N.A. Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec. 31,	  Dec. 31,</p>
<p> Quarter ended				   1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net Income					    2		749</p>
<p> Net income per common share		  0.00	     0.22</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	    3,385,568	3,354,371</p>
<p>			 (Dollars in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>NOTES - Company said net and per-share income for Q4 '96 fell after provision for loan losses increased to $1.2 million from $721,000.</p>
<p>						 Dec. 31	   Dec. 31</p>
<p> Year Ended				     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net Income					906		3,357</p>
<p> Net income per common share		0.27		 1.00</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  3,385,226	   3,356,593</p>
<p>NOTES - '96 results include one-time charge of $1.5 million or $0.44/shr for federally mandated assessment to recapitalize Federal Deposit Insurance Corp's Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
